<title>UK: LME - warehouse stock movements.</title>
<headline>LME - warehouse stock movements.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jun 05 - Latest LME warehouse stock changes are:</p>
<p>copper up 250, tin down 140, lead down 75, zinc down 375, aluminium down 3450, nickel up 96, aluminium alloy down 100</p>
